      "extract": "Θ-Categories and Tannakian duality Joost NUITEN, Bertrand TOEN July 2025 Abstract We introduce a notion of Θ-categories, which is a refinement of the notion of symmetric monoidal ∞-categories. We use this notion to prove a Tannakian duality statement, relating Θ-categories with fpqc- stacks by means of a certain stack of fiber functors in the context of Θ-categories. This provides, over a base ring of arbitrary",
